It was great meeting you and chatting about Arena @clairejyz. Thanks for having me on.

@clairejyz: "I sat down with @ml_angelopoulos to understand how @arena became the neutral judge of the AI race. It started as a research project at UC Berkeley, with PhD students asking a simple question: are we measuring AI the right way? Today, Arena is the largest real-world AI evaluation platform in the world, reaching $100M ARR in under 8 months."

The discussion covers why traditional AI benchmarks are fundamentally broken, how Arena's leaderboard became the industry standard, the Agent Mode with causal tracing, how humans are using AI agents today, and the journey from Berkeley research to $100M ARR.

